ts management.\n- Developed deploy-k8s.ps1 and deploy-k8s.sh scripts for deploying SmartAlarm services to Kubernetes, including pre-flight checks, service deployment, and health checks.\n- Implemented validate-deployment.sh script for validating the deployment status of SmartAlarm services, including checks for deployments, services, pods, health endpoints, ingress, HPA, and configuration.\n- Added build-services.sh script for building Docker images for SmartAlarm microservices with options for testing and help.\n- Introduced deploy-dev.sh script for deploying SmartAlarm microservices to a development environment using Docker Compose, including infrastructure setup and service health checks.", "tree": {"sha": "1ca3b85e1fa9e604c57bbc521689d872b277cb3f", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/arbgjr/smart-alarm/git/trees/1ca3b85e1fa9e604c57bbc521689d872b277cb3f"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/arbgjr/smart-alarm/git/commits/f0adfea803c970ee04f9c979ce526cfd3f0ee5eb", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/arbgjr/smart-alarm/commits/f0adfea803c970ee04f9c979ce526cfd3f0ee5eb", "html_url": "https://github.com/arbgjr/smart-alarm/commit/f0adfea803c970ee04f9c979ce526cfd3f0ee5eb", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/arbgjr/smart-alarm/commits/f0adfea803c970ee04f9c979ce526cfd3f0ee5eb/comments", "author": {"login": "ArmandoGuimaraes", "id": 83790177, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjgzNzkwMTc3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83790177?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArmandoGuimaraes", "html_url": "https://github.com/ArmandoGuimaraes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArmandoGuimaraes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArmandoGuimaraes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArmandoGuimaraes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "